1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,520
Good sleep is one of the simplest
ways to feel better every day.

2
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:06,710
Most adults need between seven
and nine hours each night.

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:10,940
Try to go to bed and wake up at the same
time, even on weekends, so your body clock

4
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:11,980
stays steady.

5
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:16,240
An hour before bed, dim the lights and put
your phone away, because bright screens

6
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:18,000
tell your brain it is still daytime.

7
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:20,880
Keep your bedroom cool, dark and quiet.

8
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:25,460
A cup of coffee in the late afternoon can
keep you awake hours later, so switch to

9
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:27,220
water or herbal tea after lunch.

10
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:32,060
If you cannot fall asleep after 20
minutes, get up, read a book in soft light

11
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:34,140
and go back to bed when you feel sleepy.

12
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:38,110
During the day, spend some time outside
in natural light and move your body.

13
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:42,320
Small changes like these, repeated every
night, can make your mornings brighter and

14
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:43,370
your days calmer.

15
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:47,500
If you still feel tired after weeks of
good habits, talk to a doctor, because

16
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:49,440
poor sleep can have many causes.

17
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,300
Rest is not lazy.

18
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:53,900
It is how your body and
mind repair themselves.
